{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>警方以虐兒拘捕一名男子，涉嫌掌摑其兒子。<br/></p><p>據了解，涉事的10歲男童周日因拒絕溫習，其53歲父親掌摑他的面及手。男童23歲姐姐目睹事件，之後轉述予男童學校社工，再由社工報警。男童之後送往伊利沙伯醫院留醫接受治療。警方以涉嫌虐兒，拘捕男童父親。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T05:39:21.104661+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T04:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T06:17:46.611450+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T05:37:45.182868+00:00","content_hash":"6b2d3489f076d9e71060c97c3543f3986c119da03fc94c9a420ba165a5687787","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}